# Light: binds its function Glow to the Door's dispatcher Opened when it starts. Glow gets the angle the Door sent.
dispatcher Opened(Number angle)

node 1 OnStart
entry OnStart 1
node 2 BindEvent "Opened -> Glow"
default 2 0 "Door"
exec 1 0 2

node 10 FunctionStart "Glow(a: Number)"
node 11 Format "Light: the door opened to {0} degrees"
node 12 Print
data 11 0 10 0
data 12 0 11 0
exec 10 0 12
